{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年43歲的徐子淇，於2006年與恒基兆業主席兼董事總經理李家誠結婚後淡出娛樂圈。擁有英國倫敦政治經濟學院（London School of Economics and Political Science，簡稱LSE）傳理學碩士的她婚後並未過著奢華的少奶奶生活，反而將重心轉投於慈善界，並為家族事業盡一分力。恒基旗下中環新海濱矚目項目「Central Yards」日前宣布，迎來Dior前男裝總監Kim Jones個人品牌的全球首間旗艦店。恒地聯席主席李家誠與太太徐子淇一同現身支持。活動上徐子淇在台上與Kim Jones並排行，李家誠低調走在後面，相當禮讓太太。</p><figure><img alt=\"恒地聯席主席李家誠與太太徐子淇一同現身支持Dior前男裝總監Kim Jones個人品牌的全球首間旗艦店。（IG@cathy_chui_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190005701893033984425061.png/T1DOMui5txrDPAD32EJb4dtO3njjPaLQdx3IIncdyCI\"/><figcaption>恒地聯席主席李家誠與太太徐子淇一同現身支持Dior前男裝總監Kim Jones個人品牌的全球首間旗艦店。（IG@cathy_chui_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇高貴打扮現身。（IG@cathy_chui_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190005699351154688561340.png/L91YhjmFavzaXo8v39T6ZlMF-HlOC8JI4c-8CeHPvAk\"/><figcaption>徐子淇高貴打扮現身。（IG@cathy_chui_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇十分靚女。（IG@cathy_chui_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190005696670863360139572.png/5VzAlMdsO3nTVaIRdkqEO25GSfqywUy-vDb4H7w2-B8\"/><figcaption>徐子淇十分靚女。（IG@cathy_chui_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇為家族事業盡一分力。（IG@cathy_chui_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190005693936046080852304.png/VFK4uIFuejmfpwlsqiAhj9sCzEFtGjcZOT9nDzk_Zw8\"/><figcaption>徐子淇為家族事業盡一分力。（IG@cathy_chui_official）</figcaption></figure><p>徐子淇挽Kim Jones手現身　李家誠緊隨其後禮讓太太</p><p>日前有網民在社交平台分享一段徐子淇李家誠與Kim Jones走在台上的片段。徐子淇一頭金髮，穿上一襲抹胸黑色長裙，高貴優雅不失時尚。三人手持香檳慶祝旗艦店開張，徐子淇挽住Kim Jones的手臂快步走在前面，兩人談笑風生，而李家誠則穿上西裝緩緩跟在後面，讓太太主力招呼Kim Jones，展現紳士禮讓風度。</p><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇挽Kim Jones手走在台上。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190006153128710144518739.png/Ka_RK1zZC-D-NaZJCmmLyStwO_RbT-_QN0AQjzdAEI8\"/><figcaption>徐子淇挽Kim Jones手走在台上。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人談笑風生。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190006150792351744387560.png/j1FB16mhmzypyKi2rw9b5cBEsMGbWMFFXMkhyVzJIck\"/><figcaption>兩人談笑風生。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李家誠禮讓太太行先，他緊隨其後。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1190006148216918016309476.png/uj37hLH_m2O_mTR4RhIgKdy2WiSymXwkQHSYxEB0mMQ\"/><figcaption>李家誠禮讓太太行先，他緊隨其後。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇好靚。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113564725771243520518932.jpeg/y-Y_JMD9wGSwrlX3WxS8FjwR3xJgIv8o3qf7CN6n-wg\"/><figcaption>徐子淇好靚。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇及李家誠親自落場打點其藝術項目。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113564728225042432319450.jpeg/FdzsPKMvA-VgkDvl6rzJpzWOLJUYiaP389ZwRvPWcEY\"/><figcaption>徐子淇及李家誠親自落場打點其藝術項目。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有網民偶遇徐子淇及李家誠兩夫婦現身展館並試造型。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113564730678841344560987.jpeg/SHD-QHaCjQVboCrV0zKOXy2y--UptOUbwjNyy8Izcss\"/><figcaption>有網民偶遇徐子淇及李家誠兩夫婦現身展館並試造型。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇肌膚吹彈可破。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113564991937581056425106.jpeg/uLizXvOZhwoFbGQ0Cd1rdRPDmDKbcNvfQ0KsEkNCrBI\"/><figcaption>徐子淇肌膚吹彈可破。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐子淇的老公李家誠亦有到場試戴飾物更笑得很開心，還跟藝術家合照。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260325/1113564996660629504301956.jpeg/3ukIDm2kSeYfY8bfL2zl5APvMqS64OB93Tlfft05X34\"/><figcaption>徐子淇的老公李家誠亦有到場試戴飾物更笑得很開心，還跟藝術家合照。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恒基兆業地產集團主席李家誠（中）及太太李徐子淇（右）探訪多名獨居長者，在佳節傳遞祝福和社會關懷。（恒基地產圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144439795125194752430192.jpeg/_eORNVMYKX9wHjjL2_POrzDJh2dQQ4EVMoB8KjKAfCo\"/><figcaption>恒基兆業地產集團主席李家誠（中）及太太李徐子淇（右）探訪多名獨居長者，在佳節傳遞祝福和社會關懷。（恒基地產圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李徐子淇分享，李博士為人務實並十分重情念舊。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145840258579959808607483.jpeg/ptweLfZ92KvgHP15VUlaOlYVKPjvfdhK6ajVO-mo1Ts\"/><figcaption>李徐子淇分享，李博士為人務實並十分重情念舊。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:24:29.046519+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":934,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:30.138047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:18:17.240418+00:00","content_hash":"fcae8d7b80581aa01bae00f27442ed1b2abe41c85683021e6a174a1442de73f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}